  m_Text: "[Died of Drowning]\r\nI thought Mommy and Daddy didn\u2019t want me anymore.
    They were always mad when I made a mess, always telling me to be careful. But
    I didn\u2019t mean to fall\u2014I just wanted to save Teddy."
